plugins/github/skills/resolve-feedback
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Derived from the "resolve-feedback" skill in the ruby-git project.

    repo:   https://github.com/ruby-git/ruby-git
    path:   .github/skills/resolve-feedback/SKILL.md
    commit: 9677f33103f926271be5da8f4406f532f47b3ef3

The workflow and the section structure are used verbatim, as are most of
the gh and GraphQL commands. Removing the ruby-git specifics -- the 4.x
branch, the bundle exec rake check, the sibling skill links, and the
Copilot Chat framing -- is a local modification. So are the frontmatter
note deferring to a project-local copy of the skill, and the Step 2
pagination fix, which adds --paginate and the $endCursor variable the
upstream text told the reader to use without supplying. See the git
history for the two commits that separate the vendored text from the
changes.

